    login, account, admin   the office's tools and one person's account
    selftest                a test harness, not content
    news                    nothing posted on it yet
    terms                   an unapproved draft of enforceable text
    store, shipping         no store is trading yet
    404                     by definition

  URLs use the clean form (/apply, not /apply.html) because
  vercel.json sets cleanUrls, and the canonical tag on each page has
  to agree with what is listed here. If those two ever disagree,
  Google picks one at random and it is usually the wrong one.

  lastmod is a real claim, not decoration. Update the date on a page
  when its CONTENT changes, not when a style is tweaked. A sitemap
  that says everything changed today, every day, gets ignored.
-->
